# Tech Stack

## Brand

- Product: **Sherhood** — https://sherhood.online
- Positioning: Fractional Asset Loot Protocol on Robinhood Chain

## Chain

- Robinhood Chain mainnet (chainId **4663**); testnet **46630**
- RPC: `https://rpc.mainnet.chain.robinhood.com`
- Explorer: `https://robinhoodchain.blockscout.com`
- Entry / settlement: USDG `0x5fc5360D0400a0Fd4f2af552ADD042D716F1d168`
- WETH: `0x0Bd7D308f8E1639FAb988df18A8011f41EAcAD73`
- Randomness: Chainlink VRF v2
- Asset buy + entry swap: Uniswap V3-style `exactInputSingle`
- Canonical Stock Tokens: https://docs.robinhood.com/chain/contracts/ (via `StockTokenRegistry`)

## Contracts (Foundry)

- Solidity 0.8.24, Cancun, via_IR, OpenZeppelin, forge tests
- Path: `contracts/`
- Modules: PotFactory, Pot, PotCard, RevealEngine, AssetManager, Treasury, CardMarketplace, EntryRouter, StockTokenRegistry
- Deploy: `script/RhDeploy.s.sol`

## Web (Next.js)

- Next.js App Router, React 19, Tailwind 4, Syne + DM Sans
- Wallet: Dynamic Labs + wagmi + viem
- Path: `web/`
- Pay-in: ETH / WETH (EntryRouter auto-swap) or USDG
